WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.282
First, capture the area you need. Windows: Win + Shift + S. Mac: Shift + Command + 4.

00:00:06.282 --> 00:00:07.892
Open DevSnapKit. Replace Image imports your screenshot.

00:00:07.892 --> 00:00:09.750
A screenshot. A little more context.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:11.788
Click Add text to create a caption.

00:00:11.788 --> 00:00:16.365
Write the headline your screenshot needs.

00:00:16.365 --> 00:00:19.107
Pick a typeface. Make it your own.

00:00:19.107 --> 00:00:21.345
Choose a size that reads clearly.

00:00:21.345 --> 00:00:26.868
Move the caption into clear space.

00:00:26.868 --> 00:00:28.709
Open Export and download your image.

00:00:28.709 --> 00:00:33.000
Your screenshot and words, ready to share.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:36.600
The actual downloaded image, with the finished headline.
